Morning Tab
https://github.com/nijanthan-dev/morning-tab-safari

Morning Tab is a Safari port of AI Homepage (https://github.com/ThariqS/ai-newtab)
by Thariq Shihipar, used under the MIT License. The original copyright notice
is kept in LICENSE.

Changes in this fork: Safari Web Extension support (a local visit log in place
of the history API, Safari-specific manifest permissions, guards for APIs
Safari lacks), the Xcode project in apps/safari, and the new name.
